  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mlIeMaM.jpeg\" alt=\"Essentials 合作夥伴橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h1>Some More Blocks · <img height=\"22\" width=\"79.53846153846154\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O6kUNhI.png\"></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/seface-studios/some-more-blocks?logo=github&logoColor=959da5&labelColor=353c43&color=0091c2&Current&label=Latest Release\" alt=\"最新版本\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/some-more-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available on CurseForge-test?logo=CurseForge&logoColor=fff&color=EB622B&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/some-more-blocks\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsome-more-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available on Modrinth-Download?logo=Modrinth&logoColor=fff&color=02b63a&link=https://modrinth.com/mod/some-more-blocks\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Some More Blocks</strong> 是一款 Vanilla+ 模組，為遊戲新增多種方塊變體。\n本模組新增了超過 500 種新方塊，包含磚塊、地磚、長青苔方塊、木製鑲嵌圖案等，大幅擴展您的建築可能性。</p>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"850\" height=\"472\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1ddBxB1OmlI?si=y-sKwgMfKyOPXRbo\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S4Npy2B.png\" alt=\"安裝指南\"></p>\n<ol>\n<li>下載並安裝您偏好的模組載入器<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>透過官方連結下載模組，並將其放入您的 mods 資料夾<ul>\n<li>CurseForge (您目前所在位置！)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsome-more-blocks%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li></ul></li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8CUDmM1.png\" alt=\"成為翻譯者\"></p>\n<p>想要協助將此模組推廣給更多玩家嗎？您絕對可以！</p>\n<p>無論您是精通其他語言，還是只想幫忙潤飾幾行文字，每一份貢獻都至關重要。我們感謝所有貢獻者——您的名字將被列入致謝名單，感謝您讓此模組更易於觸及！</p>\n<p>準備好要協助了嗎？歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fminecraft-some-more-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 團隊。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xbumFgJ.png\" alt=\"成為翻譯者\"></p>\n<p>發現任何異常或損壞的地方嗎？發生錯誤是常有的事，而您的協助能讓這個專案對所有人都更好。您可以在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Seface-Studios/some-more-blocks/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">開啟問題回報</a>，如果您有修復方案，甚至可以直接送出 Pull Request。我們非常感激任何協助！</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CMJ3EZ9.png\" alt=\"永誌不忘\"></p>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align:left\">\n        <h3>Seface Studios</h3>\n        <p>\n          <a href=\"mailto:contact@sefacestudios.net\" rel=\"nofollow\">contact@sefacestudios.net</a> · \n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=%252flinkout%253fremoteUrl%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSefaceStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\">𝕏 (原 Twitter)</a> · \n          <a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8fvBPrAqD\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:right;width:64px\">\n        <img height=\"64\" width=\"64\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/45r1STW.gif\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
